Hi all,

I couldn't get the alpha to net boot off the linux system. I've no idea=20
why. As noted, there wasn't even an indication of any traffic to the=20
tftp port. I think this would at least indicat that the BOOTREPLY from=20
the linux dhcp server has been correctly decoded.

